  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS - MAVI KALEM NOV 25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to provide access to legal rights and social support services for 30 women living in Esenyurt, a district of Istanbul with the highest internal and external migration and a large population, seeking support against domestic violence. The women&apos;s demands and problem-solving preferences shape the support operation. Access to services will be ensured through informational, financial, and legal counseling and guidance, along with companionship. Results will be monitored and recorded.</narrative>
  </description>
